    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Instructions in the polite imperative",
     "texto": [
      "In formal recommendations, the 3rd-person imperative is used: **Lave as mãos** (wash your hands).",
      "**Não conduza…** = do not drive… (after taking sedative medicines).",
      "**Em caso de reação…** = in case of an adverse reaction.",
      "**Procure ajuda médica** = seek medical attention."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
